  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environmental Protection Agency, Office of Air and Radiation (OAR), Advancing Sustainable Household Energy Solutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This funding will help promote clean, affordable household energy by building on past success while addressing both current and emerging challenges in the household energy sector. Objectives include increasing the adoption and use of clean household energy devices throughout the household energy community and focus on expediting the transition to cleaner, more efficient household energy systems in domestic and international settings.</narrative>
